iction to chocolate i need to  get off chocolate i mean  dancing for malta milk balls and digging  in dumpsters i'm like a clown  a chocolate clown but of course arnold's  eternal project the one person whose  good side he sees  but can bring out is helga g pataki  helga is mean and abrasive to the  neighborhood kids  especially to arnold who she secretly  loves  she shoves away anyone who tries to get  close to her sometimes literally  but thanks to his belief in people's  inherent capacity for goodness  arnold senses a side of helga that  normally only the audience gets to see  a part of her that recognizes and is  moved by kindness and beauty you think  you're so bad  but deep down i don't think you are the  tragedy of helga is that her best  attributes are squashed by neglectful  repressive home life which mongzo would  recognize as an obstacle to her growth  and happiness especially in the later  seasons  there's good evidence that helga is some  kind of budding artistic genius  remember that time she memorized the  entirety of romeo and juliet  in one freaking night no sweat i got all  night just for the chance to kiss arnold  with plausible deniability  [Music]  not to mention she's already offering  pointed critiques  a professional artwork at nine years old  you like edward hopper i do  yeah he's okay he's a little simple  though and what's this deal with women  anyway  that's pretty astute for a fourth grader  but helga's parents do just about  nothing to nurture the sprout of  creativity constantly ignoring and even  neglecting her  to lavish praise on her perfect older  sister did you pick up my winter coat  from the cleaners  what oh hell i forgot all the excitement  your sister being home from alaska but  don't worry  because the weatherman said that it  should stay above freezing for most of  the day  it's no wonder helga puts up a front to  hide her sensitive side  if only he could see past my mean  blustery veneer  into my soft mushy interior wherei